  "title": "Northrop Grumman Board Declares Quarterly Dividend",
  "summary": "FALLS CHURCH, Va., Aug. 19, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- The board of directors of Northrop Grumman Corporation (NYSE: NOC) declared a quarterly dividend of $2.47 per share on Northrop Grumman common stock, payable September 16, 2026, to shareholders of record as of the close of business August 31,",
